{ "D3D12: the network runs on the game's own device, recorded into its command list\n(no second device, no copies through shared memory, no queue crossings).\nVulkan: the network runs on a Vulkan device of its own beside the game.\nAuto: D3D12 when the runtime's check on this GPU and driver passes, otherwise Vulkan.\nChanging it recreates OpenRR.", "D3D12: mreža radi na vlastitom uređaju igre, snimljena u njezin command list\n(bez drugog uređaja, bez kopija kroz dijeljenu memoriju, bez prelazaka između queueova).\nVulkan: mreža radi na vlastitom Vulkan uređaju pokraj igre.\nAuto: D3D12 kad provjera runtimea na ovom GPU-u i driveru prođe, inače Vulkan.\nPromjena ponovno stvara OpenRR." },
