{ "Full Image", "Cijela slika" },
{ "GPU time the game's queue spends on the model each frame, all passes\ntogether: copying its inputs, waiting for its result and applying it.\n\nThe fps is 1000 divided by that time: how many frames per second the\nmodel alone could keep up with. The game runs slower than that, because\nthe rest of the frame takes time too.", "GPU vrijeme koje queue igre troši na model u svakom okviru, svi prolazi\nzajedno: kopiranje ulaza, čekanje rezultata i njegova primjena.\n\nFps je 1000 podijeljeno s tim vremenom: koliko bi okvira u sekundi\nmodel sam mogao pratiti. Igra radi sporije od toga, jer\ni ostatak okvira traje." },
{ "GPU time the game's queue spends on the model each frame: copying its\ninputs, waiting while the HIP kernels run between the two halves of\nthe game's command list, and applying the result.\n\nThe fps is 1000 divided by that time: how many frames per second the\nmodel alone could keep up with. The game runs slower than that, because\nthe rest of the frame takes time too.", "GPU vrijeme koje queue igre troši na model u svakom okviru: kopiranje\nulaza, čekanje dok HIP kerneli rade između dviju polovica\ncommand lista igre i primjena rezultata.\n\nFps je 1000 podijeljeno s tim vremenom: koliko bi okvira u sekundi\nmodel sam mogao pratiti. Igra radi sporije od toga, jer\ni ostatak okvira traje." },
{ "GPU time the game's queue spends on the model each frame: copying its\ninputs, waiting while the Vulkan network runs between the two halves of\nthe game's command list, and copying the result back.\n\nThe fps is 1000 divided by that time: how many frames per second the\nmodel alone could keep up with. The game runs slower than that, because\nthe rest of the frame takes time too.", "GPU vrijeme koje queue igre troši na model u svakom okviru: kopiranje\nulaza, čekanje dok Vulkan mreža radi između dviju polovica\ncommand lista igre i kopiranje rezultata natrag.\n\nFps je 1000 podijeljeno s tim vremenom: koliko bi okvira u sekundi\nmodel sam mogao pratiti. Igra radi sporije od toga, jer\ni ostatak okvira traje." },
{ "GPU time the model takes on each frame, all passes together:\ncopying its inputs, waiting for its result and applying it.\n\nThe fps is 1000 divided by that time: how many frames per second the\nmodel alone could keep up with.", "GPU vrijeme koje model troši na svaki okvir, svi prolazi zajedno:\nkopiranje ulaza, čekanje rezultata i njegova primjena.\n\nFps je 1000 podijeljeno s tim vremenom: koliko bi okvira u sekundi\nmodel sam mogao pratiti." },
