{ "How far CC_SILVER_AARDWOLD_OPTIMIZED goes; every level stays close to CC_SILVER_AARDWOLD's\npicture. Quality: no int4 layers. Balanced: int4 on some encoder, attention and feed-forward\nlayers. Performance: also fixed attention on the first full-resolution layers. Ultra\nPerformance (default, the fastest): also more int4 layers. A change rebuilds the network.", "Koliko daleko ide CC_SILVER_AARDWOLD_OPTIMIZED; svaka razina ostaje blizu slike\nCC_SILVER_AARDWOLD. Kvaliteta: bez int4 slojeva. Uravnoteženo: int4 na nekim encoder, attention i\nfeed-forward slojevima. Performanse: uz to i fiksni attention na prvim slojevima pune rezolucije. Ultra\nperformanse (zadano, najbrže): uz to još int4 slojeva. Promjena ponovno gradi mrežu." },
{ "How far each a-trous pass returns a downward-biased estimate\ninstead of the bilateral mean, which bounds the floor below the\nraw colour rather than letting it drift above it. Off by default:\nthe crossing it removes measures about 0.1% of a typical frame,\nwith spikes in views where detail boost lifts the floor.\nFloor Detail Boost is the knob that fixes a soft floor.", "Koliko svaki a-trous prolaz vraća procjenu pomaknutu naniže\numjesto bilateralnog prosjeka, što drži floor ispod\nsirove boje umjesto da mu dopusti da odluta iznad nje. Zadano isključeno:\nprijelaz koji uklanja u tipičnom okviru iznosi oko 0.1%,\nuz skokove u prizorima gdje detail boost podiže floor.\nFloor Detail Boost je kontrola koja popravlja mekani floor." },
{ "How far the frame moves toward the model's picture.\n\nThe model's answer is not added to the frame -- it is a complete picture of its\nown, rescaled so its luminance sits where the original says it should. This\nblends between the two, so both ends are real pictures and everything between\nthem is one too.\n\n0 gives back exactly what the upscaler produced. 1 is the model's picture.\n\nAbove 1 carries on past it in the same direction, which is not something the\nmodel asked for -- use it to see what it is doing, then come back down. This\nis the control to push if you want more effect: Intensity belongs to the model\nand it decides what to do with it.", "Koliko se okvir pomiče prema slici modela.\n\nOdgovor modela ne dodaje se okviru -- to je zasebna, potpuna slika,\nskalirana tako da joj luminancija bude ondje gdje original kaže da treba. Ovo\nstapa te dvije, pa su oba kraja prave slike, a i sve između\nnjih također.\n\n0 vraća točno ono što je dao upscaler. 1 je slika modela.\n\nIznad 1 nastavlja dalje u istom smjeru, što model nije\ntražio -- koristi to da vidiš što radi, pa se vrati dolje. Ovo je\nkontrola koju treba pojačati ako želiš više efekta: Intenzitet pripada modelu\ni on odlučuje što će s njim." },
{ "How far the handover moves from the floor toward the detail filter.\n0.0: the floor's 5x5 full median and a-trous result. Isotropic, so it\nerases strokes thinner than about 3 pixels - this is what removes panel\ntext and blends the original colours.\n1.0: entirely the filter selected below.", "Koliko se handover pomiče od floora prema filteru detalja.\n0.0: floorov puni 5x5 medijan i a-trous rezultat. Izotropan je, pa\nbriše poteze tanje od otprilike 3 piksela - to je ono što uklanja tekst\nna panelima i stapa izvorne boje.\n1.0: u potpunosti filter odabran ispod." },
{ "How long to spin if FPTHybridSpin is true. Measured in timer resolution units.\nNot recommended to go below 2. Will result in frequent overshoots", "Koliko dugo vrtjeti ako je FPTHybridSpin true. Mjeri se u jedinicama rezolucije timera.\nNe preporučuje se ići ispod 2. Dovest će do čestih prebačaja" },
{ "How many frames may be running denoise at once, 2-5. A frame that gets\na buffer waits for its own denoise; one that finds all buffers busy is\nrecorded with NO denoise at all - faster, with possible quality loss.\n\n3 (default): on Onimusha no difference from 2 was detected. In one Where\nWinds Meet A/B session, the skip counter rose by about 1200-1440 per\ntwo-slot segment and stayed flat with 3; that log window does not yield\na skip percentage.\n\n2: in that Where Winds Meet session, display latency was 47.6-47.9 ms\nversus 62.9-63.2 ms with 3, but many frames skipped denoise.\n\n4-5: measured in a separate sweep and no faster than 3 in that scene. A\nscene that actually requires a fourth or fifth slot has not been tested.\n\nEach buffer is one FP16 target at the RENDER size (the DLSS input): about\n29 MB when a 4K output renders at 1440p, 66 MB only at a native 4K render.\nOnly the selected number is allocated. No restart needed.\n\nThe ini also accepts 1 (the old single-slot path); this menu does not.", "Koliko okvira smije istodobno prolaziti denoise, 2-5. Okvir koji dobije\nbuffer čeka vlastiti denoise; onaj koji zatekne sve buffere zauzete\nsnima se BEZ ikakvog denoisea - brže, uz mogući gubitak kvalitete.\n\n3 (zadano): u Onimushi nije uočena razlika u odnosu na 2. U jednoj Where\nWinds Meet A/B sesiji brojač preskakanja rastao je za oko 1200-1440 po\nsegmentu s dva slota, a s 3 je ostao ravan; iz tog odsječka loga ne može se\ndobiti postotak preskakanja.\n\n2: u toj Where Winds Meet sesiji latencija prikaza bila je 47.6-47.9 ms\nnaspram 62.9-63.2 ms s 3, ali su mnogi okviri preskočili denoise.\n\n4-5: izmjereno u zasebnom nizu mjerenja i u toj sceni ništa brže od 3.\nScena kojoj zaista treba četvrti ili peti slot nije testirana.\n\nSvaki buffer je jedan FP16 target u RENDER veličini (DLSS ulaz): oko\n29 MB kad se 4K izlaz renderira na 1440p, 66 MB samo pri nativnom 4K renderu.\nAlocira se samo odabrani broj. Ponovno pokretanje nije potrebno.\n\nIni prihvaća i 1 (stari put s jednim slotom); ovaj izbornik ne." },
{ "How many times the model runs over the frame, each pass shown the last one's\nanswer.\n\nThe most expensive control here. Cost is exactly linear: five passes is\nfive model runs, and the model is nearly all of what this pass costs.\n\nWhat it buys that nothing else can is the model re-deciding where detail\ngoes, what hue it is, and how saturated. Detail strength amplifies the map\nthe first pass drew; it cannot redraw it.\n\nWhat it does not buy is raw magnitude. Detail strength and Intensity are\nfree and do that. Try both, and raise Model resolution, before this.\n\nPast 3, raise the ratio guard under Colour with it. The passes compound\nthe luminance ratio and the guard clamps it, so beyond its limit the extra\nruns are paid for and thrown away.\n\nEach pass is its own model, with its own memory, built on a frame of its\nown -- so raising this takes a couple of seconds to arrive, and VRAM grows\nwith it.\n\nNo effect on native Vulkan, or with the proxy path switched on.", "Koliko puta model prolazi preko okvira, pri čemu se svakom prolazu pokazuje odgovor\nprethodnog.\n\nNajskuplja kontrola ovdje. Cijena je točno linearna: pet prolaza je\npet pokretanja modela, a model je gotovo sve što ovaj prolaz stoji.\n\nOno što donosi, a ništa drugo ne može, jest da model ponovno odlučuje kamo\nidu detalji, koje su nijanse i koliko zasićeni. Jačina detalja pojačava mapu\nkoju je nacrtao prvi prolaz; ne može je nacrtati iznova.\n\nOno što ne donosi jest sirova jačina. Jačina detalja i Intenzitet su\nbesplatni i to rade. Probaj oboje i podigni Rezolucija modela prije ovoga.\n\nIznad 3 uz to podigni i klizač Zaštita svjetlina pod Boja. Prolazi umnažaju\nomjer luminancije, a zaštita ga ograničava, pa se iznad njezine granice dodatna\npokretanja plaćaju i bacaju.\n\nSvaki prolaz je zaseban model, s vlastitom memorijom, izgrađen na vlastitom\nokviru -- pa podizanje ovoga stiže za par sekundi, a VRAM raste\ns tim.\n\nNema učinka na nativnom Vulkanu ni kad je uključen proxy put." },
{ "How much of NR's change reaches the people in the mask: 1 the pass they keep, 0 the game's own\npicture there. Before the stabilizer and RenoDX's composition, which still act on the result.", "Koliko NR-ove promjene dolazi do ljudi u maski: 1 je prolaz koji zadržavaju, 0 slika same\nigre na tom mjestu. Prije stabilizatora i RenoDX kompozicije, koji i dalje djeluju na rezultat." },
{ "How much of it lands", "Koliko toga stiže" },
{ "How much of the frame each half shows.\n\nA half is half as wide as the frame and just as tall, so the frame\ncannot fill it and keep its shape.\n\nAt 1 the whole frame is there at its right proportions, with bars above\nand below. At 2 the half is filled and the sides are cropped away\ninstead. Anything between trades one for the other.", "Koliko okvira prikazuje svaka polovica.\n\nPolovica je upola uža od okvira i jednako visoka, pa je okvir\nne može ispuniti i zadržati svoj oblik.\n\nNa 1 cijeli je okvir ondje u pravim proporcijama, s trakama iznad\ni ispod. Na 2 polovica je ispunjena, a umjesto toga odrezane su\nstrane. Sve između mijenja jedno za drugo." },
{ "How much of the model's colour change reaches the frame. Above 1 it is\nexaggerated, up to twice its size at 2.", "Koliko promjene boje koju radi model dolazi do okvira. Iznad 1 je\nprenaglašena, do dvostruke veličine na 2." },
{ "How much of the model's detail reaches the frame. Above 1 it is\nexaggerated, up to twice its size at 2.", "Koliko detalja modela dolazi do okvira. Iznad 1 su\nprenaglašeni, do dvostruke veličine na 2." },
{ "How much of the network's result reaches the frame. 100% is the\nruntime's own default; 0% leaves the frame as the game drew it while\nthe network still runs. Above 100% the effect is pushed further.\n\nWith RenoDX composition on, this is the composition's intensity: above\n100% only the brightness change grows, inside the highlight guard, and\nchanging it keeps the model's history. Off, it sets the runtime's own\nstrength and every change restarts the model's history.\n\nNeeds the danielblnc runtime 0.3.1 or later without the composition.", "Koliko rezultata mreže dolazi do okvira. 100%: zadana vrijednost samog\nruntimea; 0%: okvir ostaje kakvim ga je igra nacrtala dok\nmreža i dalje radi. Iznad 100%, efekt se gura dalje.\n\nUz uključenu RenoDX kompoziciju ovo je intenzitet kompozicije: iznad\n100%, raste samo promjena svjetline, unutar zaštite svjetlina, a\npromjena zadržava povijest modela. Kad je isključena, postavlja vlastitu jačinu\nruntimea i svaka promjena iznova pokreće povijest modela.\n\nBez kompozicije treba danielblnc runtime 0.3.1 ili noviji." },
{ "How much of the previous frame's result the network's last block blends into this\none. Lower follows changes faster and steadies less. Even at 0 the network still\nreads the history; turn Temporal history off to drop it.", "Koliko rezultata prethodnog okvira zadnji blok mreže stapa u ovaj.\nNiže brže prati promjene i manje smiruje. Čak i na 0 mreža i dalje\nčita povijest; isključi Temporalna povijest da je odbaciš." },
{ "How the game's depth buffer is interpreted.\nAuto trusts a depth-stencil resource over the title's declaration,\nthen the DLSS.Use.HW.Depth declaration, then the resource flags,\nand finally assumes Hardware. The log reports which rule fired.\n\nA title that supplies hardware depth without declaring it makes RR\nsee a scene about one unit deep: the linear-depth debug view goes\nblack and disocclusion stops working. Set Hardware if you see that.\nApplied immediately; changing it resets temporal history.", "Kako se tumači depth buffer igre.\nAuto vjeruje depth-stencil resursu prije nego deklaraciji igre,\nzatim deklaraciji DLSS.Use.HW.Depth, zatim zastavicama resursa,\na na kraju pretpostavlja Hardware. Log javlja koje se pravilo primijenilo.\n\nIgra koja daje hardversku dubinu, a ne deklarira je, čini da RR\nvidi scenu duboku otprilike jednu jedinicu: debug prikaz linearne dubine\npocrni i disokluzija prestaje raditi. Postavi Hardware ako to vidiš.\nPrimjenjuje se odmah; promjena resetira temporalnu povijest." },
{ "How the model's work is brought back up when it ran below the frame's size.\n\nClassic composes the model's small picture directly against the full-size\nframe. Those two disagree by the shrink's blur as well as by the model's edit,\nand the composition cannot tell them apart -- it reads the blur as brightness\nthe frame has and the model never saw. The lower the model resolution the\nlarger that error, and it is the colour shift that shows up at 50%.\n\nMatched residual carries up only the model's difference and lays it on the\nframe's own proxy, so both pictures being compared are full size and the only\nthing that came from the small raster is the edit itself.\n\nNo effect at 100% or above: there is no residual to carry and the two are\nidentical (supersampling brings its answer down to frame size before this).\n\nFrom hhkbble's multi-pass work on this fork.", "Kako se rad modela vraća na punu veličinu kad je radio ispod veličine okvira.\n\nKlasično sastavlja malu sliku modela izravno s okvirom pune\nveličine. Te se dvije razlikuju za zamućenje od smanjivanja kao i za izmjenu modela,\na kompozicija ih ne može razlikovati -- zamućenje čita kao svjetlinu\nkoju okvir ima, a model je nikad nije vidio. Što je rezolucija modela niža,\nto je ta greška veća, i to je pomak boje koji se vidi na 50%.\n\nUsklađeni rezidual prenosi gore samo razliku modela i polaže je na\nvlastiti proxy okvira, pa su obje slike koje se uspoređuju pune veličine i jedino\nšto je došlo iz malog rastera jest sama izmjena.\n\nNa 100%, ili iznad toga, nema učinka: nema reziduala za prenijeti i oba su\nidentična (supersampling svoj odgovor prije ovoga spušta na veličinu okvira).\n\nIz hhkbbleova multi-pass rada na ovom forku." },
