{ "Keeps the mask in 0..1 before the network sees it (after the invert).\nSome games (Resident Evil Requiem) write values up to 3000, which DLSS-RR takes as they are\nand which leave trails and shimmering here. Only does something while the mask is in use.", "Drži masku u 0..1 prije nego što je mreža vidi (nakon invertiranja).\nNeke igre (Resident Evil Requiem) upisuju vrijednosti do 3000, koje DLSS-RR uzima takve kakve jesu,\na ovdje ostavljaju tragove i titranje. Djeluje samo dok se maska koristi." },
