{ "Linear hands the frame over unchanged, as danielblnc's own runtime does.\nsRGB and Gamma 2.2 decode it to linear light before the model and encode\nits answer back afterwards, which weakens the model's colour and lighting.\nSome games may still look better with one of them.", "Linearno predaje okvir nepromijenjen, kao što radi danielblncov vlastiti runtime.\nsRGB i Gamma 2.2 dekodiraju ga u linearno svjetlo prije modela i nakon toga\nkodiraju njegov odgovor natrag, što slabi boju i osvjetljenje modela.\nNeke igre ipak mogu izgledati bolje s jednim od njih." },
