{ "NR runtime: mochizuki (open-source Vulkan network on a device of its own,\nsame-frame execution). NrBackend in OptiScaler.ini picks the runtime; restart after\nchanging it.", "NR runtime: mochizuki (open-source Vulkan mreža na vlastitom uređaju,\nizvršavanje u istom okviru). NrBackend u OptiScaler.ini bira runtime; nakon promjene\nponovno pokreni igru." },
