{ "Natural and Cinematic: the network's answer is graded afterwards, as NVIDIA's DLL\ndoes, so the two styles look apart. Off gives the picture they had before (little\ndifference in some games). Standard is not graded. No rebuild.", "Prirodno i Filmski: odgovor mreže naknadno se gradira, kao u NVIDIA-inu DLL-u,\npa se ta dva stila razlikuju. Isključeno daje sliku kakvu su imali prije (mala\nrazlika u nekim igrama). Standard se ne gradira. Bez ponovne izgradnje." },
