{ "New, building", "Novo, gradi se" },
{ "New: cheaper kernels for a lower GPU time (about 8%), at a small, measured loss\nof image precision. Legacy: the kernels from before, closest to NVIDIA's output.\nSame network and histories, so it flips live and you can compare back and forth.\nThe first time, New's kernels are built in the background (up to a minute), and\nthe image stays on Legacy until then.", "Novo: jeftiniji kerneli za manje GPU vrijeme (oko 8%), uz mali, izmjereni gubitak\npreciznosti slike. Legacy: kerneli od prije, najbliži NVIDIA-inu izlazu.\nIsta mreža i povijesti, pa se mijenja uživo i možeš uspoređivati amo-tamo.\nPrvi put se kerneli za Novo grade u pozadini (do minute), a\nslika do tada ostaje na Legacy." },
