{ "Open release page", "Otvori stranicu izdanja" },
{ "OpenRR did not start, see the log", "OpenRR se nije pokrenuo, pogledaj log" },
{ "OpenRR stopped, Ray Reconstruction goes back to FSR-RR (see the log)", "OpenRR se zaustavio, Ray Reconstruction se vraća na FSR-RR (pogledaj log)" },
{ "OpenRR stopped, see the log", "OpenRR se zaustavio, pogledaj log" },
{ "OpenRR: %s", "OpenRR: %s" },
{ "Opt-in energy guard on the floor/raw clamp: the floor may not\nexceed the raw, so the share that does is replaced with a low\npass of the raw sample. That replacement is the raw's own\nnoise, and the skip signal publishes it unfiltered - so this\nputs grain back on exactly the pixels it clamps. Averaging the\nceiling attenuates it but cannot remove it, because an average\nof the raw still carries the raw's noise. 0.0 - the default -\nleaves the floor unclamped and closes the residual instead,\nwhich removes the grain rather than reducing it. Watch\nSkipRawInject to see the pixels the clamp takes.", "Opcionalna zaštita energije na floor/raw clampu: floor ne smije\npremašiti raw, pa se dio koji ga premaši zamjenjuje low\npassom raw uzorka. Ta zamjena je vlastiti šum rawa,\na skip signal ga objavljuje nefiltriranog - pa ovo\nvraća zrno upravo na piksele koje ograničava. Uprosječivanje\nstropa ga prigušuje, ali ga ne može ukloniti, jer prosjek\nrawa i dalje nosi šum rawa. 0.0 - zadano -\nostavlja floor neograničen i umjesto toga zatvara rezidual,\nšto uklanja zrno umjesto da ga smanjuje. Prati\nSkipRawInject da vidiš piksele koje clamp zahvaća." },
