{ "Relative to RR's OUTPUT resolution: 0.50x at 4K runs NR at 1920x1080.\nRR itself remains full quality. The NR edit is resized for final composition.\nPasses 2 and 3 use the same per-pass model profiles as the SR path.", "U odnosu na IZLAZNU rezoluciju RR-a: 0.50x na 4K pokreće NR na 1920x1080.\nSam RR ostaje u punoj kvaliteti. NR izmjena mijenja veličinu za završnu kompoziciju.\nProlazi 2 i 3 koriste iste profile modela po prolazu kao SR put." },
{ "Relative to the finished frame: 1.00x runs the model over every pixel of\nit, 0.50x at 4K runs it at 1920x1080 and enlarges the answer back.\nCost falls with the square of this, so it is the first control to reach\nfor when the full-size pass is too expensive.\n\nThe AMD runtime does not supersample, so this stops at 1.00x.", "U odnosu na gotov okvir: 1.00x pokreće model preko svakog njegova\npiksela, 0.50x na 4K pokreće ga na 1920x1080 i uvećava odgovor natrag.\nCijena pada s kvadratom ovoga, pa je to prva kontrola za kojom treba\nposegnuti kad je prolaz u punoj veličini preskup.\n\nAMD runtime ne radi supersampling, pa ovo staje na 1.00x." },
{ "Relax resolution checks for HUDless by 32 pixels \nHelps games which use black borders for some \nresolutions and screen ratios (e.g. Witcher 3)", "Opusti provjere rezolucije za HUDless za 32 piksela \nPomaže igrama koje koriste crne rubove za neke \nrezolucije i omjere zaslona (npr. Witcher 3)" },
{ "Relaxed Resource Check", "Opuštena provjera resursa" },
{ "Releases the floor's luminance edge stop where diffuse albedo says\ntwo taps share a material, so shadows and reflections reach the\ndenoiser instead of being captured into the floor and returned\nblurred. 0.0 restores the previous behaviour.", "Otpušta floorovo zaustavljanje na rubovima luminancije gdje difuzni albedo kaže\nda dva tapa dijele materijal, pa sjene i refleksije dolaze do\ndenoisera umjesto da budu uhvaćene u floor i vraćene\nzamućene. 0.0 vraća prijašnje ponašanje." },
{ "Remembers what was around the camera in previous frames\nand uses it to fill the screen edges and the area under your hands.\nEdge fill mode is only used where the cache has nothing.\nShown with a blue tint in debug mode", "Pamti što je bilo oko kamere u prethodnim okvirima\ni time popunjava rubove zaslona i područje ispod tvojih ruku.\nNačin ispune ruba koristi se samo gdje cache nema ništa.\nU debug načinu prikazano plavom nijansom" },
