{ "Run inside the upscaler", "Pokreni unutar upscalera" },
{ "Running natively on Vulkan - %llu frames%s", "Radi nativno na Vulkanu - %llu okvira%s" },
{ "Running on: %s", "Radi na: %s" },
{ "Running the FP8 experimental network", "Radi eksperimentalna FP8 mreža" },
{ "Running the optimized network, Optimized layers: %s", "Radi optimizirana mreža, Optimizirani slojevi: %s" },
{ "Running%s - %.2f ms per frame%s", "Radi%s - %.2f ms po okviru%s" },
{ "Runs FP8 matrices, which only an RX 9000 has.", "Koristi FP8 matrice, koje ima samo RX 9000." },
{ "Runs NR on the D3D9, D3D11, D3D12, Vulkan or OpenGL frame when the game has no upscaler.\nRequires the danielblnc AMD runtime. The HUD is included.\nFidelityFX estimates motion. D3D11 uses a bound shader-readable depth buffer when available.\nVulkan shares the image with D3D12 when the driver permits; otherwise host readback adds latency.\nA classic D3D9 device copies each frame through system memory; D3D9Ex shares it with D3D12.\nOpenGL needs OptiScaler installed as opengl32.dll and shares the back buffer with D3D12.\nScene cuts reset history; the runtime noise seed is fixed on supported versions.", "Pokreće NR na D3D9, D3D11, D3D12, Vulkan ili OpenGL okviru kad igra nema upscaler.\nZahtijeva danielblnc AMD runtime. HUD je uključen.\nFidelityFX procjenjuje kretanje. D3D11 koristi vezani depth buffer čitljiv shaderu kad je dostupan.\nVulkan dijeli sliku s D3D12 kad driver to dopušta; inače host readback dodaje latenciju.\nKlasični D3D9 uređaj kopira svaki okvir kroz sistemsku memoriju; D3D9Ex ga dijeli s D3D12.\nOpenGL treba OptiScaler instaliran kao opengl32.dll i dijeli back buffer s D3D12.\nRezovi scene resetiraju povijest; seed šuma runtimea fiksan je na podržanim verzijama." },
{ "Runs Neural Rendering on the render-resolution colour input immediately before\nSuper Resolution, so SR temporally accumulates and upscales the enhanced frame.\n\nRay Reconstruction is deliberately excluded: its input contract differs and\nuses the separate Apply after Ray Reconstruction option. Origin-zero padded\ninputs use their active render size; offset or invalid inputs fall back post-SR.\n\nThis placement control currently applies to the Direct3D 12 path and its\nDirect3D 11/Vulkan bridges; native Vulkan keeps the post-upscale path.", "Pokreće Neural Rendering na ulazu boje u render rezoluciji neposredno prije\nSuper Resolutiona, pa SR temporalno akumulira i upscalea poboljšani okvir.\n\nRay Reconstruction je namjerno izuzet: njegov ulazni ugovor je drukčiji i\nkoristi zasebnu opciju Primijeni nakon Ray Reconstructiona. Ulazi s paddingom od ishodišta\nnula koriste svoju aktivnu render veličinu; pomaknuti ili neispravni ulazi vraćaju se na post-SR.\n\nOva kontrola položaja trenutno vrijedi za Direct3D 12 put i njegove\nDirect3D 11/Vulkan mostove; nativni Vulkan zadržava put nakon upscalea." },
{ "Runs before Super Resolution only, so a game driving Ray Reconstruction gets no NR. Built for a render resolution of 1080p or less.", "Radi samo prije Super Resolutiona, pa igra koja koristi Ray Reconstruction ne dobiva NR. Napravljeno za render rezoluciju 1080p ili manju." },
{ "Runs before Super Resolution only. The first start builds the network in about half a minute; later starts take a second or two.", "Radi samo prije Super Resolutiona. Prvo pokretanje gradi mrežu oko pola minute; kasnija traju sekundu ili dvije." },
{ "Runs the AMD neural model over the finished frame instead of over the\nupscaler's or Ray Reconstruction's render-resolution input.\n\nWith it off the model stays pre-SR, on the render-resolution Color input\nbefore Super Resolution or DLSS-RR. Under FSR-RR it runs between the\ndenoise and the upscale, on the denoised colour.\n\nThe model history is rebuilt when the placement changes, so expect a few\nframes of warm-up after toggling it.", "Pokreće AMD neuronski model preko gotovog okvira umjesto preko ulaza\nupscalera ili Ray Reconstructiona u render rezoluciji.\n\nKad je isključeno, model ostaje pre-SR, na Color ulazu u render rezoluciji\nprije Super Resolutiona ili DLSS-RR. Pod FSR-RR radi između\ndenoisea i upscalea, na odšumljenoj boji.\n\nPovijest modela ponovno se gradi kad se položaj promijeni, pa očekuj nekoliko\nokvira zagrijavanja nakon prebacivanja." },
{ "Runs the model again on its own output, for a stronger effect.\nEach pass adds the model's whole GPU time to every frame.", "Ponovno pokreće model na vlastitom izlazu, za jači efekt.\nSvaki prolaz dodaje cijelo GPU vrijeme modela svakom okviru." },
{ "Runs the network as machine code made in advance by ACO, the Linux driver's compiler,\ninstead of compiling it with AMD's Windows one: about a fifth faster, the same picture.\nCC_SMALL_FP8_EXPERIMENTAL and CC_SILVER_AARDWOLD_OPTIMIZED need it. Tested by its\nauthor on AMD Software 26.9.2 only; if the game crashes or the picture is wrong, turn\nit off. Save Settings and start the game again to apply it.", "Pokreće mrežu kao strojni kod koji je unaprijed napravio ACO, kompajler Linux drivera,\numjesto da je kompajlira AMD-ov za Windows: oko petinu brže, ista slika.\nTrebaju ga CC_SMALL_FP8_EXPERIMENTAL i CC_SILVER_AARDWOLD_OPTIMIZED. Autor ga je\ntestirao samo na AMD Software 26.9.2; ako se igra ruši ili je slika kriva,\nisključi ga. Za primjenu pritisni Spremi postavke i ponovno pokreni igru." },
{ "Runs the network at its full cost but shows the frame as the game drew it, to\nmeasure the cost or compare with and without the effect.", "Pokreće mrežu uz punu cijenu, ali prikazuje okvir kakvim ga je igra nacrtala, za\nmjerenje cijene ili usporedbu sa i bez efekta." },
