{ "Sets ApplyAfterRR to false; danielblnc then runs before Super Resolution / Ray\nReconstruction too, if you switch back to it.", "Postavlja ApplyAfterRR na false; danielblnc tada također radi prije Super Resolutiona / Ray\nReconstructiona, ako se vratiš na njega." },
