{ "Such an aggressive upscaling? A bold move", "Tako agresivan upscaling? Hrabar potez" },
{ "Supersampling %.2fx: the model runs ABOVE native, then\nis sampled back down. Experimental, and costly -- time grows with the area.", "Supersampling %.2fx: model radi IZNAD nativne, zatim se\nuzorkuje natrag naniže. Eksperimentalno i skupo -- vrijeme raste s površinom." },
